            "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:55:56.757146+00:00",
            "notes": "[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6) are the main things to buy this round, getting started on CDR early is very helpful for living longer while you don't have high HP. If you need to sell [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to afford them do it. Heartbeat doesn't matter much now that we have the movespeed from [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6), although it is fun to stack them if you have the cash.",
