            "created_at": "2025-09-24T12:55:56.757146+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 7 there is a lot of variety in potential powers to take. This depends on both your personal playstyle and what the enemies are doing.\n\nBecause we have [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7), both normal bubble and [Pocket Projector](item_5c95fa4f-6f53-494e-9b4a-a7e2766cb1e8) deal damage meaning that if you're making physical contact with someone inside the bubble while your pocket bubble is up the damage stacks. [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6) makes keeping up with people in the bubble much easier to make this more reliable.\n\nOur CDR also makes [Surge Protector](item_5a653c7a-e156-449c-905b-83a1a54e7f93) very high value especially if playing with someone who is diving with us in the bubble like [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) or [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a). \n\nIf you want to move to more single target damage you can go for [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228) and buying [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) instead of [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).\n\nPersonally I'd recommend [Surge Protector](item_5a653c7a-e156-449c-905b-83a1a54e7f93) for helping your teammates out too and buffing everyone rather than just yourself.",
